FFmpeg 9.0 Build Notes
======================

License: LGPL-2.1+

--------------------------------------------------
macOS arm64 (Apple Silicon - Native)
--------------------------------------------------

Configure:
./configure \
  --prefix="$PWD/build-macos-arm64" \
  --arch=arm64 \
  --cc=clang \
  --disable-debug \
  --disable-doc \
  --disable-ffplay \
  --disable-indevs \
  --disable-outdevs \
  --disable-avdevice \
  --enable-static \
  --disable-shared

Build:
make -j$(sysctl -n hw.logicalcpu)
make install

--------------------------------------------------
macOS x86_64 (Intel - Cross compile on Apple Silicon)
--------------------------------------------------

Configure:
./configure \
  --prefix="$PWD/build-macos-x64" \
  --arch=x86_64 \
  --cc="clang -arch x86_64" \
  --extra-cflags="-arch x86_64" \
  --extra-ldflags="-arch x86_64" \
  --disable-debug \
  --disable-doc \
  --disable-ffplay \
  --disable-indevs \
  --disable-outdevs \
  --disable-avdevice \
  --enable-static \
  --disable-shared

Build:
make -j$(sysctl -n hw.logicalcpu)
make install

--------------------------------------------------
Common Options
--------------------------------------------------
- Static build only (--enable-static --disable-shared)
- No debug symbols
- No documentation
- No ffplay
- No input/output devices
- No avdevice